        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&#10;Blue: structural context (always-on schema, opt-in distinct values)&#10;Green: domain context (markdown skill file, opt-in)&#10;Orange: conversational context (in-memory chat history, opt-in)&#10;Red: the user's natural-language question&#10;Yellow: the prompt template that fuses everything above&#10;Purple: the LLM API call" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
